Feature: Placeholder Page Validation
  As a user or developer,
I want to verify that the placeholder page is correctly displayed,
So that I can confirm the page is reserved for future content and does not expose broken functionality.

This feature ensures that the placeholder at https://example.com loads successfully and presents the expected temporary content or 'under construction' message, confirming the site's structural integrity without showing incomplete features.

